{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/745333-happy-halloween-folks","id":745333,"title":"Happy Halloween folks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-31T16:50:30-07:00","id":745333,"title":"Happy Halloween folks","content":"Just what it says on the tin.<br /> <br /> The ghouls and goblins are out, and for the next few hours the barriers between realms of the living and the dead will dissolve, and evil things will have sway.<br /> <br /> Have fun and stay safe.<br /> <br /> Now if you'll excuse me I need to take my kids trick or treating, then to a Halloween party, then raid some G-M infrastructure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-31T19:17:15-07:00","id":745560,"title":"","content":"I hope you all had a fun time at your parties or with your kids or whatever the hell you did tonight. Stayed in and watched Wes Craven movies or whatever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-31T20:05:38-07:00","id":745633,"title":"","content":"I did laundry!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T01:18:47-08:00","id":746153,"title":"","content":"I had a good time. 33 trick-or-treaters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T04:08:08-08:00","id":746323,"title":"","content":"I don't give a toss about Halloween, or really any holiday. A day is important to me because of its potential, not because of the commercial rituals I'm expected to engage in during it. But I have nieces who're both still in the single digits, and they were gonna come over last night after trick-or-treating to show off their costumes, so as a concession to the spirit of festivity, I wore this shirt:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/fz/api/res/1.2/Cjztir0ypvtE3kNH8ZYkRA--/YXBwaWQ9c3JjaGRkO2g9NDUwO3E9OTU7dz01NTA-/http://shirtigo.co/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/ghostbusted.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> My eldest niece, nine, was dressed up like an angel. Her moms had put a lot of effort into making her hair wavy, and she looked very nice. My youngest niece, who's two years and a couple of months, was dressed up like a kitty, and she was immediately distressed by my shirt; she kept insisting her mom lift her up so she could point at my chest and repeat, &quot;Wa hoppen? He ouchie? Wa hoppen? Ma, wa hoppen?&quot; until I grabbed my hoodie from the coat stand and covered it up.<br /> <br /> I don't know where she picked up the imagery of what a person in a casket looks like, but there you go. The story is equal parts heartbreaking and cute for me. Dunno how you'll take it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T21:52:33-08:00","id":748410,"title":"","content":"I went off to visit some friends and run a game. Call of Cthulhu 7e (the new one).<br /> <br /> Players started off survivors of a shipwreck with some limited food and no water, arriving in a mysteriously new but completely abandoned town a few scant months after V-E day during WW II.<br /> <br /> They figured it out in the end (after losing a lot of sanity) and realized that the Elder God summoned as a retribution in case Germany lost the war didn't want them, it only wanted their Hostess Twinkies(tm).<br /> <br /> Yes, I ran a CoC based on the old hostess twinkies adverts they shoved in all the comics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-02T03:38:14-08:00","id":748846,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/745333-happy-halloween-folks?p=748410#post748410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, I ran a CoC based on the old Hostess Twinkies adverts they shoved in all the comics.</div> </div> </div> </div>And you were very correct to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-02T07:39:58-08:00","id":749137,"title":"","content":"I answered the door for trick-or-treaters wearing the mask* I put on to certain conventions; it got about the same positive reaction it does there, with parents and the older kids reacting favourably, and the younger kids being reluctant to come close enough to be given candy, and even a couple who actually hid behind their parents' legs.<br /> <br /> There's a lot to be said for something utilitarian, but striking; the essence of good horror can often be the entirely mundane with a single uncanny detail out of place.<br /> <br /> The last ones of the evening even asked me what it was supposed to be, letting me get in my favoured line of &quot;a man wearing a mask&quot;; they were old enough to appreciate that.<br /> <br /> (I also continued answering the door even after we had run out to personally apologise, because I was hardly going to obviously be in the house and ignore callers; I've <i>been</i> that child, and it is no fun.)<br /> <br /> * and my black hat and coat, but that's how I dress all of the time, even if it's what really helps the mask to pop.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-02T09:33:47-08:00","id":749345,"title":"","content":"I went to a party at a friend's house.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.